-Both agents share the same two tools: `search_wiki` (calls `dspy.Retrieve(k=20)`, returns top-20 passages concatenated) and `get_entity_profile` (calls `dspy.Retrieve(k=7)` with an entity name, returns top-7 passages). The two-pass design addresses the core failure mode of the single-pass approach: premature termination that misses valid answer paths in questions with high graph branching factor.
